The built-in nebula catalogue's coordinate data is generated from VizieR
catalogues (Sharpless / LBN / vdB / Cederblad); follow CDS/VizieR citation
rules when redistributing. Survey prior data (e.g. the Finkbeiner 2003 Halpha
map, NASA LAMBDA) is obtained by the user under its own terms.

